{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Step 1: the worked example\nThe teacher runs the OMG *Hardware retailer* with forms and shows its variables in Operate. Watch, then answer.",
      "id": "class_s02_part_a_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Feedback.** {{fbPartA}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbPartA = null or fbPartA = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s02_part_a_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "checklist",
      "key": "a1",
      "label": "1. Which variables exist when the instance starts? (select all that apply)",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "orderId",
          "value": "orderId"
        },
        {
          "label": "weightKg",
          "value": "weightKg"
        },
        {
          "label": "orderValue",
          "value": "orderValue"
        },
        {
          "label": "deliveryMode",
          "value": "deliveryMode"
        },
        {
          "label": "insuranceRequired",
          "value": "insuranceRequired"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s02_part_a_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "a1b",
      "label": "2. Which variable appears after *Decide if normal post or special shipment*?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "deliveryMode",
          "value": "deliveryMode"
        },
        {
          "label": "orderValue",
          "value": "orderValue"
        },
        {
          "label": "None: a task only moves the token",
          "value": "none"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s02_part_a_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "a2",
      "label": "3. The OMG model has data objects. What do they store in the engine?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "Nothing: they document; the data is the instance's variables",
          "value": "nothing"
        },
        {
          "label": "The order, as a variable called like the data object",
          "value": "order"
        },
        {
          "label": "A file attached to the instance",
          "value": "file"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s02_part_a_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "key": "a3",
      "label": "4. The teacher changed orderValue in Operate. Where did the change show up?",
      "values": [
        {
          "label": "In the next form that was opened: it showed the new value",
          "value": "nextForm"
        },
        {
          "label": "Nowhere: running instances keep the old value",
          "value": "nowhere"
        },
        {
          "label": "Only in new instances",
          "value": "newInstances"
        }
      ],
      "validate": {
        "required": true
      },
      "id": "class_s02_part_a_5"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s02-part-a",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
